1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:13,512
Writing, task one. Form number 11. You stayed in a hotel on holiday. The hotel wants your feedback. Answer the questions in a full sentence, at least ten words.

2
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:15,842
What did you like about the hotel?

3
00:00:26,233 --> 00:00:30,711
I liked the clean room, the excellent breakfast and the very friendly staff.

4
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,273
What didn't you like and why?

5
00:00:43,667 --> 00:00:47,340
I didn't like that the spa was small and there were too many people there in the evening.

6
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:50,325
Will you come again? Why?

7
00:01:00,733 --> 00:01:05,546
Yes, we'll come again because the nature here is beautiful and the food is good.

8
00:01:06,433 --> 00:01:15,790
Fill in form 11 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
